Absolutely, there are many resources available to learn Python and to deepen your understanding of programming:

    CS50's Web Programming with Python and JavaScript: This is a follow-up course to CS50 that dives deeper into programming, teaching languages like Python and JavaScript.

    Python.org: The official Python website has a wealth of resources, including tutorials and documentation.

    Codecademy: This interactive platform offers a Python course that includes hands-on coding exercises.

    Project Euler: This website provides a series of challenging mathematical/computer programming problems that will require more than just mathematical insights to solve. A good way to improve your Python skills.

    LeetCode: This platform has a collection of problems that can help you prepare for technical interviews. You can solve these problems using Python.

Remember, the key to learning programming is practice. Try to code a little bit every day, and don't be afraid to challenge yourself with difficult problems. Happy coding!
